#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:85 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:118
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:118 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:122
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:119 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:146
msgid "Aqueduct"
msgstr "上水道"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:103
msgid "Allows a city to grow larger than size 10."
msgstr "都市が規模10を超えて成長できるようにします。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:105
msgid ""
"An Aqueduct also eliminates a city's risk of plague causing loss of "
"population, and of fire causing loss of buildings."
msgstr ""
"上水道はまた、疫病による人口減少や火災による都市施設の喪失のリスクを都市から"
"なくします。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:111 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:142
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:144 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:239
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:236 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:172
msgid "Bank"
msgstr "銀行"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:131 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:162
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:164 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Together with the Marketplace improvement, a Bank increases the luxury and "
"tax production within a city by 100%."
msgstr "市場と合わせて、銀行は都市の贅沢と税の生産を100%増加させます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:158 data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:189
#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:219
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With a Barracks, each new unit built in a city will automatically have "
"Veteran status, which means that its attack and defense strengths are "
"increased by 50%."
msgstr ""
"兵舎があると、都市で生産される新しいユニットは自動的に熟練状態になり、攻撃力"
"と防御力が50%増加します。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:162 data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:193
#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:223
msgid ""
"Barracks also prevent stored food and goods in coastal cities being lost to "
"piracy."
msgstr ""
"兵舎はまた、沿岸都市に蓄えられた食料や物資が海賊に奪われるのを防ぎます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:168 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:199
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:202 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:297
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:294 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:230
msgid "Barracks II"
msgstr "兵舎(改良)"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:199 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:230
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:234 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:329
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:326 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:262
msgid "Barracks III"
msgstr "兵舎(新改良)"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:229 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:260
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:264 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:359
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:356 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:292
msgid "Cathedral"
msgstr "大聖堂"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:247
msgid ""
"A Cathedral makes 4 unhappy citizens content in a city, making it easier to "
"maintain order in that city; however, it does not affect citizens made "
"unhappy by military activity."
msgstr ""
"大聖堂は都市の不満市民4人を平穏にし、都市の秩序を保ちやすくします。ただし、軍"
"事活動によって不満になった市民には効果がありません。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:273
msgid ""
"City Walls make it easier to defend a city.  They triple the defense "
"strength of units within the city. They are ineffective against Artillery "
"and Bombers. City Walls also prevent the loss of population which occurs "
"when a defending unit is destroyed by a land unit."
msgstr ""
"城壁は都市の防衛を容易にします。都市内のユニットの防御力を3倍にします。大砲と"
"爆撃機には効果がありません。城壁はまた、防御ユニットが陸上ユニットに撃破され"
"たときに起こる人口の減少も防ぎます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:279
msgid ""
"For cities near rivers, City Walls also eliminate the risk of population "
"loss from flooding."
msgstr "川の近くの都市では、城壁は洪水による人口減少のリスクもなくします。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:285 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:342
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:347
msgid "Colosseum"
msgstr "円形闘技場"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:303
msgid ""
"Entertains the citizens of a city, making 3 unhappy citizens content.  "
"However, it does not affect citizens made unhappy by military activity."
msgstr ""
"都市の市民を楽しませ、不満市民3人を平穏にします。ただし、軍事活動によって不満"
"になった市民には効果がありません。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:309 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:367
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:374 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:471
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:468 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:375
msgid "Courthouse"
msgstr "裁判所"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Reduces the corruption in a city by 50%. Has no effect in your capital city."
msgstr "都市の汚職を50%減らします。首都では効果がありません。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:334 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:396
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:403 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:502
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:499 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:234
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:404
msgid "Factory"
msgstr "工場"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:353 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:415
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:422 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:423
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Increases the shield production in a city by 50%.  This increase may also "
"contribute significantly to pollution."
msgstr ""
"都市のシールド生産を50%増加させます。この増加は汚染にも大きく寄与することがあ"
"ります。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:377 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:439
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:446 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:447
msgid ""
"The amount of stored food will be set to half full whenever a city with a "
"Granary shrinks or grows. This helps a city to grow faster and more easily "
"withstand famine."
msgstr ""
"穀物庫のある都市が縮小または成長したとき、蓄えられた食料は半分の量に設定され"
"ます。これにより都市は速く成長でき、飢饉にも耐えやすくなります。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:385
msgid ""
"Famine can occur when food stock reaches zero due to a food deficit (which a "
"Granary merely delays), in which case it leads to the loss of any Settlers "
"consuming food, or of city population if there are none. Famine can also "
"occur at any time due to random crop failure, in which case it causes loss "
"of population and all stored food; a Granary eliminates this risk."
msgstr ""
"飢饉は食料不足により食料の備蓄が0になったときに起こることがあり (穀物庫はこれ"
"を遅らせるだけです)、その場合は食料を消費している開拓者が失われるか、いなけれ"
"ば都市の人口が失われます。また、ランダムな凶作によっていつでも飢饉が起こるこ"
"とがあり、その場合は人口とすべての蓄えられた食料が失われます。穀物庫はこのリ"
"スクをなくします。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:395 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:475
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:482 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:591
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:588 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:480
msgid "Hydro Plant"
msgstr "水力発電所"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:416 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:496
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Reduces the amount of pollution generated by production in a city by 50%.  "
"It also increases the shield production of a Factory or Mfg. Plant in the "
"city: a Factory and a Hydro Plant together give a 100% production bonus, and "
"a Factory, Mfg. Plant and Hydro Plant together give a 150% production bonus."
msgstr ""
"都市の生産によって発生する汚染の量を50%減らします。また、都市の工場や製造プラ"
"ントのシールド生産を増加させます。工場と水力発電所で合わせて100%、工場、製造"
"プラント、水力発電所で合わせて150%の生産ボーナスが得られます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:423
msgid ""
"A city can only have one Hydro Plant, Power Plant, or Nuclear Plant.  A city "
"can only build a Hydro Plant if it is next to (or on) a River tile."
msgstr ""
"都市が持てるのは水力発電所、火力発電所、原子力発電所のいずれか1つだけです。水"
"力発電所を建設できるのは、川のタイルに隣接している (またはその上にある) 都市"
"だけです。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:432 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:512
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:522 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:636
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:633 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:517
msgid "Library"
msgstr "図書館"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:451 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:531
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:655
#, no-c-format
msgid "Increases the science output in a city by 50%."
msgstr "都市の科学の産出を50%増加させます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:456 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:536
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:546 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:660
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:658 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:541
msgid "Marketplace"
msgstr "市場"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:475 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:555
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:565 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:679
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:677 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:560
#, no-c-format
msgid "Increases the luxury and tax output in a city by 50%."
msgstr "都市の贅沢と税の産出を50%増加させます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:480 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:560
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:570 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:684
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:682 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:565
msgid "Mass Transit"
msgstr "公共交通機関"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:498 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:578
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:588 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:583
msgid ""
"Neutralizes the pollution generated by the population.  The population "
"simply has no effect on the pollution generated in the city."
msgstr ""
"人口によって発生する汚染を無効にします。都市で発生する汚染に人口がまったく影"
"響しなくなります。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:505 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:585
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:595 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:709
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:707 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:590
msgid "Mfg. Plant"
msgstr "製造プラント"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:525
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Together with a Factory, a Manufacturing Plant increases the shield "
"production in a city by 100%."
msgstr "工場と合わせて、製造工場は都市のシールド生産を100%増加させます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:531 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:612
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:625 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:747
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:745 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:617
msgid "Nuclear Plant"
msgstr "原子力発電所"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:551 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Reduces the amount of pollution generated by production in a city by 50%.  "
"It also increases the shield production of a Factory or Mfg. Plant in the "
"city: a Factory and a Nuclear Plant together give a 100% production bonus, "
"and a Factory, Mfg. Plant and Nuclear Plant together give a 150% production "
"bonus."
msgstr ""
"都市の生産によって発生する汚染の量を50%減らします。また、都市の工場や製造プラ"
"ントのシールド生産を増加させます。工場と原子力発電所で合わせて100%、工場、製"
"造プラント、原子力発電所で合わせて150%の生産ボーナスが得られます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:558 data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:635
msgid "A city can only have one Hydro Plant, Power Plant, or Nuclear Plant."
msgstr ""
"都市が持てるのは水力発電所、火力発電所、原子力発電所のいずれか1つだけです。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:567 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:673
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:694 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:820
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:818 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:678
msgid "Palace"
msgstr "宮殿"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:586 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:713
msgid ""
"Makes a city the capital and the center of your government. Corruption in "
"other cities is related to how far away from the capital they are, except "
"when the government is Democracy or Communism. On top of this, corruption in "
"your capital itself is half of what it would otherwise be (as if it had a "
"Courthouse)."
msgstr ""
"都市を首都とし、政府の中心にします。他の都市の汚職は首都からの距離に関係しま"
"す (政治体制が民主主義または共産主義の場合を除く)。さらに、首都自体の汚職は通"
"常の半分になります (裁判所があるのと同様)。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:592
msgid ""
"The cost to enemy Diplomats of inciting a revolt in a city also depends upon "
"the city's distance from the capital (under all forms of government). Your "
"capital city itself cannot be incited to revolt, and enjoys a bonus when "
"enemy agents try to evade your own agents stationed in the city, or sabotage "
"your buildings."
msgstr ""
"敵の外交官が都市で反乱を扇動する費用も、(すべての政治体制で) 首都からの距離に"
"よって決まります。首都自体では反乱を扇動されず、敵の工作員が都市に駐留するあ"
"なたの工作員から逃れようとしたり、あなたの都市施設を破壊工作しようとしたりす"
"るときにボーナスを得ます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:598 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:706
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:726 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:852
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:850 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:711
msgid ""
"Take good care of your capital, as its loss may result in your empire "
"plunging into civil war. Losing your current palace also results in losing "
"whatever spaceship you might have."
msgstr ""
"首都の喪失は帝国を内戦に陥れることがあるため、首都は大切に守りましょう。現在"
"の宮殿を失うと、持っている宇宙船もすべて失われます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:602 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:710
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:730 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:856
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:854 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:715
msgid ""
"If the capital is in a dangerous location, or a more central capital would "
"give a better corruption distribution, you can move your palace by "
"rebuilding it in another city."
msgstr ""
"首都が危険な場所にある場合や、より中心にある首都のほうが汚職の分布がよくなる"
"場合は、別の都市に宮殿を再建することで宮殿を移転できます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:609 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:769
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:797 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:989
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:958 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:779
msgid "Power Plant"
msgstr "火力発電所"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:629 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:789
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Increases the shield production of a Factory or Mfg. Plant in a city: a "
"Factory and a Power Plant together give a 100% production bonus, and a "
"Factory, Mfg. Plant and Power Plant together give a 150% production bonus.  "
"The extra production may lead to the city generating more pollution."
msgstr ""
"都市の工場や製造プラントのシールド生産を増加させます。工場と火力発電所で合わ"
"せて100%、工場、製造プラント、火力発電所で合わせて150%の生産ボーナスが得られ"
"ます。追加の生産により都市が発生させる汚染が増えることがあります。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:641 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:801
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:834 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1024
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:993 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:813
msgid "Recycling Center"
msgstr "リサイクル施設"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:660 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:820
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:853 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:832
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Building a Recycling Center reduces the amount of pollution generated by "
"production in a city by 66%."
msgstr ""
"リサイクル施設を建設すると、都市の生産によって発生する汚染の量が66%減ります。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:666 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:878
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:911 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1108
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1077 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:890
msgid "SDI Defense"
msgstr "SDI 防衛システム"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:684
msgid ""
"Protects a city and its environs (up to 2 tiles away) from attacks by other "
"nations' Nuclear units. A Nuclear unit not owned by you or a teammate which "
"attacks a city with SDI Defense, or attacks a unit (or is deliberately "
"exploded) within range, is shot down and simply has no effect."
msgstr ""
"都市とその周辺 (2タイル以内) を他国の核ユニットの攻撃から守ります。あなたや"
"チームメイトが所有していない核ユニットが、SDI 防衛システムのある都市を攻撃し"
"たり、範囲内のユニットを攻撃したり (または意図的に爆発させられたり) すると、"
"撃墜されてまったく効果がありません。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:692 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:964
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1004 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1203
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1172 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:615
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:981
msgid "Space Component"
msgstr "宇宙コンポーネント"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:710 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:982
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1023 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1225
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1194 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:633
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1000
msgid ""
"Space Components can be differentiated into Propulsion and Fuel Components.  "
"Each pair of them reduces your spaceship's travel time.  You can build up to "
"8 pairs."
msgstr ""
"宇宙コンポーネントは推進部品と燃料部品に分けられます。それぞれ1組ごとに宇宙船"
"の移動時間が短くなります。最大8組まで建設できます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:714 data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:751
#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:779 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:986
#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1023 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1051
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1027 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1065
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1094 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1229
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1307 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1339
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1198 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1239
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1271
msgid ""
"Before you can build any spaceship parts, the Apollo Program wonder must "
"have been built by any player."
msgstr ""
"宇宙船の部品を建設するには、いずれかのプレイヤーがアポロ計画の不思議を建設し"
"ている必要があります。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:720 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:992
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1033 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1272
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1204 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:640
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1010
msgid "Space Module"
msgstr "宇宙モジュール"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:738 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1010
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1052 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1294
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1226 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:658
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1029
msgid ""
"Space Modules are the most expensive parts of spaceships.  There are three "
"different types of Space Module:"
msgstr ""
"宇宙モジュールは宇宙船で最も高価な部品です。宇宙モジュールには3種類あります:"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:741 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1013
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1055 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1297
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1229 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:661
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1032
msgid "- Habitation Module: provides living space for 10,000 people."
msgstr "- 居住モジュール: 1万人の居住空間を提供します。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:743 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1015
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1057 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1299
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1231 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:663
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1034
msgid ""
"- Life Support Module: provides food and water for the population of one "
"Habitation Module."
msgstr ""
"- 生命維持モジュール: 居住モジュール1つ分の人口に食料と水を提供します。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:746 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1018
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1060 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1302
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1234 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:666
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1037
msgid ""
"- Solar Panels: provides the energy needed for any two of the other Modules."
msgstr "- 太陽電池パネル: 他のモジュール2つ分に必要なエネルギーを提供します。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:749 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1021
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1063 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1305
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1237 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:669
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1040
msgid "You can build up to 4 Space Modules of each kind."
msgstr "宇宙モジュールは各種類につき最大4つまで建設できます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:757 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1029
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1071 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1313
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1245 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:674
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1048
msgid "Space Structural"
msgstr "宇宙船構造物"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:775 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1047
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1090 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1335
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1267 data/alien/buildings.ruleset:692
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1067
msgid ""
"Space Structurals form the base of your spaceship.  All other spaceship "
"parts need to be connected to Structurals in order to function.  You can "
"build up to 32 Space Structurals."
msgstr ""
"宇宙船構造物は宇宙船の土台となります。他のすべての宇宙船部品は、機能するため"
"に構造材に接続されている必要があります。宇宙船構造物は最大32個まで建設できま"
"す。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:785 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1136
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1181 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1433
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1365 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1156
msgid "Temple"
msgstr "寺院"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:803
msgid ""
"Makes one unhappy citizen content. The Mysticism advance doubles this "
"effect, as does the Oracle wonder. With both Mysticism and the Oracle, 4 "
"citizens are made content. Does not affect citizens made unhappy by military "
"activity."
msgstr ""
"不満市民1人を平穏にします。神秘主義の科学技術でこの効果は2倍になり、アポロー"
"ン神殿の不思議でも同様です。神秘主義とアポローン神殿の両方があれば市民4人が平"
"穏になります。軍事活動によって不満になった市民には効果がありません。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:808
msgid ""
"A Temple in a city near mountains additionally prevents population loss from "
"volcanic activity."
msgstr "山の近くの都市にある寺院は、火山活動による人口減少も防ぎます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:814 data/civ1/techs.ruleset:645
#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1162 data/civ2/techs.ruleset:813
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1207 data/classic/techs.ruleset:816
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1459 data/sandbox/techs.ruleset:870
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1391 data/civ2civ3/techs.ruleset:845
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1182 data/multiplayer/techs.ruleset:821
msgid "University"
msgstr "大学"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:834 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Together with a Library, a University increases the science production of a "
"city by 100%."
msgstr "図書館と合わせて、大学は都市の科学の生産を100%増加させます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:840 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1188
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1233 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1521
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1423 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1208
msgid "Apollo Program"
msgstr "アポロ計画"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:855
msgid ""
"All cities on the map become visible for the player who owns it -- the "
"player always has up-to-date knowledge of all tiles with cities despite fog-"
"of-war. It allows all players to start building spaceship parts (assuming "
"they have researched the necessary technologies)."
msgstr ""
"これを所有するプレイヤーには、マップ上のすべての都市が見えるようになります。"
"戦場の霧に関係なく、都市のあるすべてのタイルについて常に最新の情報を得られま"
"す。また、すべてのプレイヤーが宇宙船の部品の建設を開始できるようになります "
"(必要な科学技術を研究していることが前提です)。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:864 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1239
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1284 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1608
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1485 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1259
msgid "Colossus"
msgstr "巨像"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:883 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1258
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1303 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1627
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1504 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1279
msgid ""
"Each tile around the city where this wonder is built that is already "
"generating some trade produces one extra trade resource."
msgstr ""
"この不思議を建設した都市の周辺のタイルのうち、すでに交易を産出しているタイル"
"は、さらに交易を1産出します。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:889 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1264
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1309 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1633
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1510 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1285
msgid "Copernicus' Observatory"
msgstr "コペルニクスの天文台"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:909 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Boosts science production by 50% in the city where it is built."
msgstr "建設した都市の科学の生産を50%増加させます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:914 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1288
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1333 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1658
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1535 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1310
msgid "Cure For Cancer"
msgstr "癌の治療"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:932 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1306
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1351
msgid ""
"This stunning technological achievement makes one unhappy citizen content in "
"each of your cities (including citizens unhappy about military activity)."
msgstr ""
"この驚くべき技術的成果は、あなたの各都市で不満市民1人を平穏にします (軍事活動"
"による不満市民を含む)。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:939 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1313
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1361 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1686
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1563 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1338
msgid "Darwin's Voyage"
msgstr "ダーウィンの航海"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:957 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1331
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1379
msgid ""
"Charles Darwin's voyage sparked the discovery of the evolution of the "
"species, which inspired greater confidence in science. Gives two immediate "
"technology advances."
msgstr ""
"チャールズ・ダーウィンの航海は種の進化の発見をもたらし、科学への信頼を高めま"
"した。即座に科学技術を2つ得ます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:964 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1363
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1411 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1770
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1617 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1389
msgid "Great Library"
msgstr "アレクサンドリア図書館"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:983 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1382
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1430
msgid ""
"The civilization which builds the Great Library gets every advance that at "
"least two other teams have achieved."
msgstr ""
"アレクサンドリア図書館を建設した文明は、少なくとも2つの他のチームが獲得したす"
"べての科学技術を得ます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:989 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1388
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1436 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1800
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1645 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1414
msgid "Great Wall"
msgstr "万里の長城"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1008 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1407
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1455
msgid "Works as a City Wall in all your cities."
msgstr "あなたのすべての都市で城壁として機能します。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1015 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1414
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1463 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1828
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1673 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1439
msgid "Hanging Gardens"
msgstr "空中庭園"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1034
msgid ""
"Makes one content citizen happy in every city. In the unlikely event where "
"there are no content citizens to get the effect of Hanging Gardens, the "
"wonder applies to unhappy citizens instead (including those unhappy about "
"military activity), making each content."
msgstr ""
"すべての都市で平穏な市民1人を満足にします。空中庭園の効果を受ける平穏な市民が"
"いないというまれな場合には、代わりに不満市民 (軍事活動による不満市民を含む) "
"に適用され、それぞれ平穏にします。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1042 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1443
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1492 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1855
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1700 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1468
msgid "Hoover Dam"
msgstr "フーバーダム"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1060
msgid ""
"Works as if you had a Hydro Plant in every city on the same continent where "
"the wonder is built.  (This reduces pollution and increases the effects of "
"Factories and Mfg. Plants.)"
msgstr ""
"この不思議を建設した大陸にあるすべての都市に水力発電所があるのと同様に機能し"
"ます。(汚染を減らし、工場と製造プラントの効果を高めます。)"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1068 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1467
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1517 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1883
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1728 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1495
msgid "Isaac Newton's College"
msgstr "ニュートンの学士院"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1088 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1486
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1328 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1305
#, no-c-format
msgid "Boosts science production by 100% in the city where it is built."
msgstr "建設した都市の科学の生産を100%増加させます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1093 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1491
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1542 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1911
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1756 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1521
msgid "J.S. Bach's Cathedral"
msgstr "J.S.バッハの大聖堂"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1111
msgid ""
"Makes two unhappy citizens content in every city of yours on the same "
"continent where the wonder is built (including citizens unhappy about "
"military activity)."
msgstr ""
"この不思議を建設した大陸にあるあなたのすべての都市で、不満市民2人を平穏にしま"
"す (軍事活動による不満市民を含む)。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1118 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1564
