#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1206
msgid "Double effects of Cathedrals, in all cities."
msgstr "すべての都市で大聖堂の効果を2倍にします。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1211 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1687
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1740 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1728
