#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1230 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1706
msgid ""
"Doubles the effect of a Temple in every city. Does not affect citizens made "
"unhappy by military activity."
msgstr ""
"すべての都市で寺院の効果を2倍にします。軍事活動によって不満になった市民には効"
"果がありません。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1236 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1712
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1766 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:2197
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:2042 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1755
msgid "Pyramids"
msgstr "ピラミッド"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1255 data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1330
#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1803 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1859
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1852
msgid ""
"Allows you to choose any government, including those that have not yet been "
"researched by your civilization, and without the transition period of "
"Anarchy."
msgstr ""
"あなたの文明がまだ研究していないものを含め、どの政治体制でも選ぶことができ、"
"無政府状態の移行期間もありません。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1262 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1735
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1792
msgid "SETI Program"
msgstr "SETI計画"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1281
#, no-c-format
msgid "Boosts science production in each city by 50%."
msgstr "各都市の科学の生産を50%増加させます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1286 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1760
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1816 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:2254
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:2099 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1807
msgid "Shakespeare's Theater"
msgstr "シェイクスピアの劇場"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1306 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1779
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1835 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1827
msgid ""
"Makes all angry and unhappy citizens content in the city where it is "
"located, including citizens unhappy about military activity."
msgstr ""
"この遺産がある都市のすべての激怒市民と不満市民を平穏にします。軍事活動による"
"不満市民も含みます。"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1312 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1837
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1893 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:2421
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:2180 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1886
msgid "United Nations"
msgstr "国際連合"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1342 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1868
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1916 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:2453
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:2212 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1911
msgid "Women's Suffrage"
msgstr "婦人参政権"

#: data/civ1/buildings.ruleset:1360
msgid ""
"In all cities, the unhappiness effect of every unit is reduced by 1. This "
"means that in a Republic, units do not cause unhappiness, and in a "
"Democracy, aggressive units cause only 1 unhappy citizen each."
msgstr ""
"すべての都市で、各ユニットによる不満の効果が1減ります。つまり、共和制ではユ"
"ニットは不満を引き起こさず、民主主義では攻撃的なユニットがそれぞれ不満市民を1"
"人しか生みません。"

#: data/civ1/cities.ruleset:48 data/civ2/cities.ruleset:48
#: data/classic/cities.ruleset:48 data/sandbox/cities.ruleset:48
#: data/civ2civ3/cities.ruleset:48 data/multiplayer/cities.ruleset:47
