msgstr "ベテラン"

#. TRANS: Unit class: used adjectivally
#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:131 data/civ2/units.ruleset:146
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:152 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:172
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:162 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:152
msgid "?unitclass:Land"
msgstr "陸上"

#. TRANS: Unit class: used adjectivally
#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:140 data/civ2/units.ruleset:158
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:164 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:209
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:199 data/alien/units.ruleset:151
#: data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:164
msgid "?unitclass:Sea"
msgstr "海上"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:144 data/civ2/units.ruleset:35
#: data/civ2/units.ruleset:162 data/classic/units.ruleset:42
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:56 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:50
#: data/sandbox/units.ruleset:72 data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:44
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:62 data/alien/units.ruleset:155
#: data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:42 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:56
msgid "Can launch attack from non-native tiles."
msgstr "ネイティブでないタイルから攻撃を開始できる。"

#. TRANS: Unit class: used adjectivally
#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:150 data/civ2/units.ruleset:175
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:185 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:234
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:221 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:185
msgid "?unitclass:Air"
msgstr "航空"

#. TRANS: Unit class: used adjectivally
#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:157 data/civ2/units.ruleset:139
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:145 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:164
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:154 data/alien/units.ruleset:181
#: data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:145
msgid "?unitclass:Missile"
msgstr "ミサイル"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:428 data/civ2/units.ruleset:437
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:447 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:497
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:484 data/alien/units.ruleset:444
#: data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:447
msgid "Settlers"
msgstr "開拓者"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:455 data/civ2/units.ruleset:465
msgid ""
"Settlers are one of the key units in the game, as they are your main means "
"of founding new cities, and can also improve terrain; see the help on "
"Terrain and Terrain Alterations."
msgstr ""
"開拓者はゲームで最も重要なユニットの1つです。新しい都市を建設する主な手段であ"
"り、地形の改良もできます。地形と地形改変のヘルプを参照してください。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:459 data/classic/units.ruleset:486
msgid ""
"Upkeep for Settlers is in food as well as production, and a Settler can die "
"if its supporting city runs out of food. Settlers in a Republic or Democracy "
"require twice as much food per turn."
msgstr ""
"開拓者の維持費は生産に加えて食料もかかり、維持している都市の食料が尽きると開"
"拓者は死亡することがあります。共和制や民主主義の開拓者は毎ターン2倍の食料を必"
"要とします。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:466
msgid "Militia"
msgstr "民兵"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:493 data/civ2/units.ruleset:551
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:619 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:748
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:694 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:620
msgid ""
"This unit may be built from the start of the game.  It is the weakest "
"offensive unit."
msgstr ""
"このユニットはゲームの開始時から生産できます。最も弱い攻撃ユニットです。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:499 data/civ2/units.ruleset:557
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:625 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:754
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:700 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:626
msgid "Phalanx"
msgstr "ファランクス"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:529 data/civ2/units.ruleset:587
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:655 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:784
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:730 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:656
msgid "The Phalanx is armored infantry, suitable for defending your cities."
msgstr "ファランクスは装甲を備えた歩兵で、都市の防衛に適しています。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:534 data/civ2/units.ruleset:628
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:696 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:825
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:771 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:697
msgid "Legion"
msgstr "レギオン"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:564 data/civ2/units.ruleset:658
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:726 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:855
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:801 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:727
msgid ""
"Legions are heavily armed and well disciplined infantry units with an "
"excellent offensive value."
msgstr "レギオンは重武装で規律のとれた歩兵ユニットで、優れた攻撃力を持ちます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:570 data/civ2/units.ruleset:704
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:772 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:897
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:843 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:773
msgid "Musketeers"
msgstr "マスケット兵"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:601
msgid ""
"Musketeers are infantry equipped with early firearms and replace Phalanx as "
"the preferred city defender."
msgstr ""
"マスケット兵は初期の火器を装備した歩兵で、ファランクスに代わって都市の防衛に"
"適したユニットとなります。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:608 data/civ2/units.ruleset:861
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:890 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:935
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:881 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:930
msgid "Riflemen"
msgstr "ライフル兵"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:638 data/civ2/units.ruleset:891
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:920 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:965
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:911 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:960
msgid ""
"Riflemen are World War-era infantry, very good at defending your cities."
msgstr "ライフル兵は世界大戦期の歩兵で、都市の防衛に非常に優れています。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:644 data/civ2/units.ruleset:973
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1002 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1182
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1123 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1042
msgid "Mech. Inf."
msgstr "機械化歩兵"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:674
msgid ""
"Mechanized Infantry; this unit has the strongest defense strength of any "
"land unit, but is only available near the end of the technology tree."
msgstr ""
"機械化歩兵。このユニットは陸上ユニットの中で最も高い防御力を持ちますが、科学"
"技術ツリーの終盤近くでしか利用できません。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:681 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1227
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1184 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1441
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1382 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1296
msgid "Cavalry"
msgstr "騎兵隊"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:711
msgid ""
"Cavalry are mounted warriors and an early shock-troop that can penetrate "
"deep into enemy territory."
msgstr ""
"騎兵隊は馬に乗った戦士であり、敵の領土の奥深くまで侵入できる初期の突撃部隊で"
"す。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:718 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1047
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1076 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1258
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1199 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1116
msgid "Chariot"
msgstr "チャリオット"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:748
msgid ""
"Chariots are horse-pulled war wagons, stronger but more expensive than "
"Cavalry."
msgstr ""
"チャリオットは馬に引かれた戦闘用の車両で、騎兵隊より強力ですが高価です。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:754 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1155
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1112 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1370
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1311 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1224
msgid "Knights"
msgstr "騎士"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:785 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1186
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1143 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1401
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1342 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1255
msgid "Knights are mounted and heavily armored warriors."
msgstr "騎士は馬に乗り、重装甲を身につけた戦士です。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:790 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1262
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1219 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1476
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1417 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1331
msgid "Armor"
msgstr "機甲部隊"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:820 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1292
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1249 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1361
msgid ""
"Armors are motorized war wagons that are faster, stronger, and can take more "
"damage than any mounted unit."
msgstr ""
"機甲部隊は動力付きの戦闘車両で、どの騎乗ユニットよりも速く強力で、より多くの"
"損害に耐えられます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:827 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1299
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1256 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1515
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1456 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1368
msgid "Catapult"
msgstr "カタパルト"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:857 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1329
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1286 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1545
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1486 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1398
msgid ""
"Catapults are large rock-throwing machines of war. They are very strong "
"attackers but equally weak defenders and will need an escort to be effective."
msgstr ""
"カタパルトは岩を投げる大型の戦争機械です。攻撃力は非常に高いものの防御力は同"
"じくらい低く、効果を発揮するには護衛が必要です。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:864 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1336
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1293 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1557
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1498 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1405
msgid "Cannon"
msgstr "カノン砲"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:894 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1366
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1323 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1435
msgid ""
"Cannons are large firearms that can fire heavy projectiles over long "
"distances. They are very strong attackers but equally weak defenders and "
"will need an escort to be effective."
msgstr ""
"カノン砲は重い砲弾を遠くまで撃ち出せる大型の火器です。攻撃力は非常に高いもの"
"の防御力は同じくらい低く、効果を発揮するには護衛が必要です。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:902 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1374
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1331 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1595
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1536 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1443
msgid "Artillery"
msgstr "大砲"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:932
msgid ""
"The artillery is an upgraded cannon with improved defensive as well as "
"offensive capabilities. It can shoot over city walls, ignoring their effect."
msgstr ""
"砲兵は大砲を改良したもので、防御力と攻撃力の両方が向上しています。城壁を越え"
"て射撃でき、城壁の効果を無視します。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:939 data/civ2/units.ruleset:38
#: data/civ2/units.ruleset:1448 data/classic/units.ruleset:1405
#: data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1669 data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1610
#: data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1517
msgid "Fighter"
msgstr "戦闘機"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:970 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1486
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1442 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1700
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1641 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1554
msgid ""
"Fighters are your first airborne units. They can move anywhere and attack "
"any unit."
msgstr ""
"戦闘機は最初の航空ユニットです。どこへでも移動でき、どのユニットでも攻撃でき"
"ます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:976 data/civ2/units.ruleset:39
#: data/civ2/units.ruleset:1492 data/classic/units.ruleset:45
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1448 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1711
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1652 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:45
#: data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1560
msgid "Bomber"
msgstr "爆撃機"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1006 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1522
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1478 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1742
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1683 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1590
msgid ""
"Bombers are specialized airborne units that may only attack ground targets, "
"not other airborne units."
msgstr ""
"爆撃機は地上の目標のみを攻撃できる特殊な航空ユニットで、他の航空ユニットは攻"
"撃できません。"

#. TRANS: unit type
#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1014 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1650
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1608 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:1884
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1825 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1719
msgid "Trireme"
msgstr "トライリーム"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1045 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1681
msgid ""
"The Trireme is your first boat unit. It can act as a transport ship and has "
"rudimentary offensive capabilities, but may not stray too far from the shore."
msgstr ""
"トライリームは最初の船ユニットです。輸送船として機能し、初歩的な攻撃能力も持"
"ちますが、海岸から遠く離れることはできません。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1052
msgid "Sail"
msgstr "帆船"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1083
msgid ""
"The Sail replaces the Trireme and is much more reliable on the open seas."
msgstr "帆船はトライリームに代わるもので、外洋でもはるかに信頼できます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1089 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1763
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1721 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2002
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1942 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1832
msgid "Frigate"
msgstr "フリゲート"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1120 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1794
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1752 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1863
msgid ""
"The Frigate is a highly versatile boat unit, that is both a strong offensive "
"unit as well as a decent transport ship."
msgstr ""
"フリゲートは非常に用途の広い船ユニットで、強力な攻撃ユニットであると同時にそ"
"れなりの輸送船でもあります。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1127 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1801
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1759 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2038
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:1978 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1870
msgid "Ironclad"
msgstr "装甲艦"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1157 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1831
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1789 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1900
msgid ""
"The Ironclad is an armored ship that is much more sturdy than the Frigate "
"but loses the latter's transport capability."
msgstr ""
"装甲艦は装甲を施した船で、フリゲートよりもはるかに頑丈ですが、フリゲートの輸"
"送能力は失われています。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1164 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1876
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1834 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2117
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2057 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1945
msgid "Cruiser"
msgstr "巡洋艦"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1194 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1906
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1864 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2147
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2087 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:1975
msgid "The Cruiser is a strong offensive boat unit."
msgstr "巡洋艦は強力な攻撃用の船ユニットです。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1199 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1951
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1909 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2192
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2132 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2020
msgid "Battleship"
msgstr "戦艦"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1229 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1981
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1939 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2226
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2162 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2050
msgid ""
"The Battleship is the supreme naval unit with excellent offensive and "
"defensive values."
msgstr "戦艦は優れた攻撃力と防御力を持つ最高の海軍ユニットです。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1235 data/civ2/units.ruleset:1987
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1945 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:33
#: data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2232 data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:33
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2168 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2056
msgid "Submarine"
msgstr "潜水艦"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1266 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2020
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1978 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2265
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2201 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2089
msgid ""
"Traveling under the surface of the ocean, Submarines have a very high "
"strategic value, but a weak defense if caught off guard."
msgstr ""
"海面下を移動する潜水艦は非常に高い戦略的価値を持ちますが、不意を突かれると防"
"御は弱いです。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1273 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2027
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:1985 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2312
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2208 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2096
msgid "Carrier"
msgstr "航空母艦"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1304 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2058
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2016 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2346
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2239 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2127
msgid "The Carrier is a mobile airport."
msgstr "航空母艦は移動可能な空港です。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1306 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2060
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2018 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2352
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2245 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2129
msgid ""
"TIP:  Guard Carriers with a handful of fast-moving ships and a battleship, "
"as losing a fully-equipped Carrier is VERY painful and expensive."
msgstr ""
"ヒント: 完全装備の航空母艦を失うのは非常に痛手で高くつくため、航空母艦は数隻"
"の高速艦と戦艦で護衛しましょう。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1313 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2067
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2025 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2359
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2252 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2136
msgid "Transport"
msgstr "輸送艦"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1344 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2098
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2056 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2396
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2289 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2167
msgid ""
"The Transport cannot attack on its own but may defend itself when under "
"attack."
msgstr ""
"輸送艦は自ら攻撃することはできませんが、攻撃を受けたときは自身を防衛できま"
"す。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1380 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2173
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2137 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2549
#: data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2248
msgid ""
"You can build Nuclear units when you have the required advance, and the "
"Manhattan Project wonder has been built by any player."
msgstr ""
"必要な科学技術を持っており、いずれかのプレイヤーがマンハッタン計画の不思議を"
"建設していれば、核ユニットを生産できます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1383 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2176
msgid ""
"On impact, the blast will destroy any unit in an area 3 tiles wide (3x3 "
"squares for rectangular grids), including friendly units. Any city within "
"the blast area loses half its population, and land tiles within the blast "
"area are subject to nuclear fallout, which appears as pollution and "
"contributes to global warming."
msgstr ""
"着弾すると、爆発によって幅3タイルの範囲 (四角形のグリッドでは3x3マス) にある"
"すべてのユニットが、味方のユニットも含めて破壊されます。爆発の範囲内にある都"
"市は人口の半分を失い、範囲内の陸地タイルは死の灰を受けます。死の灰は汚染とし"
"て現れ、地球温暖化に寄与します。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1389 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2182
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2148 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2259
msgid ""
"TIP 1:  Nuking the ocean will not generate fallout, and is a most effective "
"(but expensive!!) way of getting rid of enemy ships."
msgstr ""
"ヒント1: 海を核攻撃しても死の灰は発生しないため、敵の艦船を排除する最も効果的"
"な (ただし高価な!) 方法です。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1393
msgid ""
"TIP 2:  You may be involved in a situation where you've invaded an enemy "
"country en masse, but the enemy cities are too strong. Before using a "
"Nuclear unit, assemble a gang of Settlers next to the city and have them "
"ready to fix the fallout on the same turn it occurs!  This minimizes the "
"chance of global warming.  Eco-friendly nukes!"
msgstr ""
"ヒント2: 敵国に大軍で侵攻したものの、敵の都市が強すぎるという状況になることが"
"あります。核ユニットを使う前に、都市の隣に開拓者の一団を集め、死の灰が発生し"
"たその同じターンに除去できるよう準備しておきましょう! これにより地球温暖化の"
"可能性を最小限に抑えられます。環境に優しい核兵器です!"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1403 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2196
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2162 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2577
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2404 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2273
msgid "Diplomat"
msgstr "外交官"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1438 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2231
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2205 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2622
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2449 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2316
msgid ""
"A Diplomat is an official that carries your dispatches and is authorized to "
"deal with foreign dignitaries. He may also undertake various covert "
"operations with the intent of harming your opponents; Diplomats in your own "
"cities defend them against such actions."
msgstr ""
"外交官はあなたの公文書を運び、外国の要人と交渉する権限を与えられた役人です。"
"また、相手に損害を与えることを目的としたさまざまな秘密工作を行うこともありま"
"す。自分の都市にいる外交官は、そのような行動から都市を守ります。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1444 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2237
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2211 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2322
msgid ""
"Many covert actions may be attempted even in peacetime, but the more "
"aggressive actions will be discovered and cause diplomatic incidents, which "
"can allow Republics and Democracies to break treaties."
msgstr ""
"多くの秘密工作は平時でも試みることができますが、より攻撃的な行動は発覚して外"
"交事件を引き起こし、共和制や民主主義の国が条約を破棄できるようになることがあ"
"ります。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1448 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2241
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2215 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2326
msgid ""
"If a foreign unit is alone on a tile, you may attempt to bribe it with your "
"Diplomat. By paying a sum of gold the unit will immediately become yours; "
"the exact sum depends on the status of the unit and that of the civilization "
"owning it. However, units belonging to Democratic governments cannot be "
"bribed. Bribery when not at war will cause a diplomatic incident."
msgstr ""
"外国のユニットがタイルに単独でいる場合、外交官を使って買収を試みることができ"
"ます。金を支払うと、そのユニットは即座にあなたのものになります。正確な金額は"
"ユニットの状態とそれを所有する文明の状態によって決まります。ただし、民主主義"
"の政府に属するユニットは買収できません。戦争中でないときに買収すると外交事件"
"が起こります。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1455 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2248
msgid ""
"Diplomats can also perform a number of actions in another player's city, "
"although each Diplomat may attempt only one action. Most of these actions "
"have a chance of failure. Also, any enemy Diplomats or Spies in the city "
"will oppose hostile actions; in this case, either your unit or the defending "
"unit will die. If the defending unit dies, you lose one movement point and "
"may try again."
msgstr ""
"外交官は他のプレイヤーの都市でさまざまなアクションも実行できますが、各外交官"
"が試みることができるのは1つのアクションだけです。これらのアクションのほとんど"
"には失敗の可能性があります。また、都市にいる敵の外交官やスパイが敵対的な行動"
"に対抗します。その場合、あなたのユニットか防御側のユニットのどちらかが死亡し"
"ます。防御側のユニットが死亡した場合、あなたは移動力を1失い、再び試みることが"
"できます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1462 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2255
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2230 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2648
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2475 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2341
msgid "The actions available to Diplomats in a city are:"
msgstr "都市で外交官が実行できるアクションは次のとおりです:"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1464 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2257
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2232 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2343
msgid ""
" - \"Establish Embassy\": This action always succeeds, and gives permanent "
"contact with the city's owner, as well as intelligence on their tax rates "
"and technology."
msgstr ""
" - 「大使館設置」: このアクションは必ず成功し、都市の所有者との恒久的な接触"
"と、その税率や科学技術に関する情報が得られます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1468 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2261
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2236 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2347
msgid ""
" - \"Investigate City\": Your unit attempts to report detailed information "
"about the city: its status, what buildings and units are within, and what it "
"is currently producing."
msgstr ""
" - 「都市調査」: ユニットは都市に関する詳細な情報、つまりその状態、内部にある"
"都市施設とユニット、現在生産しているものを報告しようとします。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1472 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2265
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2240 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2661
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2488 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2351
msgid ""
" - \"Sabotage City\": Your unit attempts either to disrupt all the city's "
"work so far towards its current project, or to destroy an existing building "
"in the city, at random. Once built, Palaces and Wonders cannot be sabotaged, "
"and attempts to sabotage City Walls or any building in a capital each halve "
"the chance of success. Sabotage may only be attempted when openly at war."
msgstr ""
" - 「都市破壊工作」: ユニットは、都市の現在の生産にこれまでに費やされた作業を"
"すべて妨害するか、都市にある既存の都市施設を破壊するかのどちらかを、ランダム"
"に試みます。建設済みの宮殿と不思議は破壊工作の対象にならず、城壁や首都の都市"
"施設への破壊工作はそれぞれ成功率が半分になります。破壊工作は公然と戦争中のと"
"きにのみ試みることができます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1479 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2272
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2247 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2668
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2495 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2358
msgid ""
" - \"Steal Technology\": Your unit attempts to learn the secrets of a random "
"technology known to the city's owner but not to you. Technology may only be "
"stolen once from a given enemy city by Diplomats. This action may be "
"attempted even when not at war, but will cause a diplomatic incident."
msgstr ""
" - 「科学技術窃盗」: ユニットは、都市の所有者が知っていてあなたが知らない科学"
"技術の秘密をランダムに1つ習得しようとします。外交官が特定の敵の都市から科学技"
"術を盗めるのは1回だけです。このアクションは戦争中でなくても試みることができま"
"すが、外交事件を引き起こします。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1485 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2278
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2253 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2364
msgid ""
" - \"Incite a Revolt\": In return for gold a foreign city will change "
"allegiance and join your empire, bringing along all nearby units that call "
"it home, but reducing its size by 1. Units in other cities remain in the "
"enemy's control, but units outside cities are lost to both players. The "
"exact sum depends on the status of the city and that of the civilization "
"that owns it. It is not possible to incite a rebellion in a capital, or in "
"any city governed by a democracy. Incitement may be attempted in peacetime, "
"but will cause a diplomatic incident."
msgstr ""
" - 「反乱扇動」: 金と引き換えに、外国の都市が忠誠を変えてあなたの帝国に加わ"
"り、そこを本拠地とする近くのすべてのユニットも連れてきますが、都市の規模は1減"
"ります。他の都市にいるユニットは敵の支配下に残りますが、都市の外にいるユニッ"
"トは両方のプレイヤーから失われます。正確な金額は都市の状態とそれを所有する文"
"明の状態によって決まります。首都や民主主義が統治する都市では反乱を扇動できま"
"せん。扇動は平時でも試みることができますが、外交事件を引き起こします。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1495 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2288
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2263 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2683
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2510 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2374
msgid ""
"In some game strategies, hordes of Diplomats can be used to wreak havoc on "
"the enemy.  Little wonder that Diplomats are often viewed with suspicion and "
"fear!"
msgstr ""
"ゲームの戦略によっては、大勢の外交官を使って敵に大打撃を与えることができま"
"す。外交官がしばしば疑いと恐れの目で見られるのも無理はありません!"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1502 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2359
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2347 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2784
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2608 data/alien/units.ruleset:1469
#: data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2458
msgid "Caravan"
msgstr "キャラバン"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1532 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2389
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2377
msgid ""
"A Caravan carries goods or material for trading with distant cities and "
"foreign countries, or to help build wonders in your cities."
msgstr ""
"キャラバンは、遠くの都市や外国と交易するための商品や物資を運んだり、自分の都"
"市での不思議の建設を支援したりします。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1535 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2392
msgid ""
"Caravans can establish trade routes with your own cities or those of other "
"nations (even enemies) by traveling to them. A route's ongoing revenue is "
"doubled if the two cities involved are on different continents, and doubled "
"again if the cities are from different civilizations. This last condition "
"means the net benefit to your civilization of a trade route is the same "
"regardless of whether you own both cities or only one of them; if you only "
"own one city, trade in each city is doubled, but you only get the benefit "
"from one end of the route. Each city can support a maximum of three trade "
"routes."
msgstr ""
"キャラバンは、自分の都市や他の民族 (敵も含む) の都市まで移動して交易路を開設"
"できます。交易路の継続的な収入は、2つの都市が異なる大陸にある場合は2倍にな"
"り、異なる文明の都市である場合はさらに2倍になります。この最後の条件により、交"
"易路があなたの文明にもたらす正味の利益は、両方の都市を所有していても一方だけ"
"を所有していても同じになります。一方の都市だけを所有している場合、各都市の交"
"易は2倍になりますが、利益を得られるのは交易路の一方の端だけです。各都市が持て"
"る交易路は最大3つです。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1545 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2402
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2393
msgid ""
"Every Caravan that is used to build a wonder will add 50 shields towards the "
"production of the wonder."
msgstr ""
"不思議の建設に使われたキャラバンは、それぞれ不思議の生産に50シールドを追加し"
"ます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1548 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2405
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2396 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2831
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2654 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2494
msgid ""
"TIP:  You can stockpile a stack of Caravans in advance and bring them all "
"into a city where you have started to build a wonder, and finish it in only "
"one turn!"
msgstr ""
"ヒント: 前もってキャラバンの集団を蓄えておき、不思議の建設を始めた都市にまと"
"めて送り込めば、たった1ターンで完成させられます!"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1555 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2484
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2516 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:2967
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2790 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2615
msgid "Barbarian Leader"
msgstr "蛮族の指導者"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1582 data/civ2/units.ruleset:2511
#: data/classic/units.ruleset:2551 data/sandbox/units.ruleset:3002
#: data/civ2civ3/units.ruleset:2824 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:2650
msgid ""
"One Barbarian Leader appears every time there is a barbarian uprising "
"somewhere in the world."
msgstr "世界のどこかで蛮族の蜂起が起こるたびに、蛮族の指導者が1人現れます。"

#: data/civ1/units.ruleset:1585
msgid ""
"When a Barbarian Leader is killed on a tile without any defending units, the "
"ransom is paid, but only to land units. Usually the ransom is 100 gold, but "
"can be less if the barbarian has less money."
msgstr ""
"防御ユニットのいないタイルで蛮族の指導者を倒すと身代金が支払われますが、陸上"
"ユニットにのみ支払われます。通常、身代金は金100ですが、蛮族の所持金が少ない場"
"合は少なくなることがあります。"

#: data/civ2/actions.ruleset:266 data/classic/actions.ruleset:283
#: data/sandbox/actions.ruleset:317 data/civ2civ3/actions.ruleset:291
#: data/multiplayer/actions.ruleset:280
#, c-format
msgid "%sSabotage City Escape%s"
msgstr "都市破壊工作して脱出(%sS)%s"

#: data/civ2/actions.ruleset:270 data/classic/actions.ruleset:287
#: data/sandbox/actions.ruleset:321 data/civ2civ3/actions.ruleset:295
#: data/multiplayer/actions.ruleset:284
#, c-format
msgid "Industrial %sSabotage%s"
msgstr "産業破壊工作(%sS)%s"

#: data/civ2/actions.ruleset:274 data/classic/actions.ruleset:291
#: data/sandbox/actions.ruleset:325 data/civ2civ3/actions.ruleset:299
#: data/multiplayer/actions.ruleset:288
#, c-format
msgid "Industrial %sSabotage Production%s"
msgstr "生産への産業破壊工作(%sS)%s"

#: data/civ2/actions.ruleset:278 data/classic/actions.ruleset:295
#: data/sandbox/actions.ruleset:329 data/civ2civ3/actions.ruleset:303
#: data/multiplayer/actions.ruleset:292
#, c-format
msgid "Indus%strial Espionage%s"
msgstr "産業スパイ(%sT)%s"

#: data/civ2/actions.ruleset:290 data/classic/actions.ruleset:311
#: data/sandbox/actions.ruleset:341 data/civ2civ3/actions.ruleset:315
#: data/multiplayer/actions.ruleset:304
#, c-format
msgid "%sSabotage Enemy Unit%s"
msgstr "敵ユニット破壊工作(%sS)%s"

#: data/civ2/actions.ruleset:302
#, c-format
msgid "Plant %sNuclear Device%s"
msgstr "核爆弾を仕掛ける(%sN)%s"

#: data/civ2/actions.ruleset:314 data/classic/actions.ruleset:355
#: data/sandbox/actions.ruleset:429 data/civ2civ3/actions.ruleset:355
#: data/alien/actions.ruleset:296 data/multiplayer/actions.ruleset:340
#, c-format
msgid "%sParadrop to Contested Landing%s"
msgstr "係争地への降下(%sP)%s"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:105 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:105
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:105 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:105
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:104
msgid ""
"Allows a city to produce veteran air units (including helicopters and "
"missiles). Also, damaged air units (again, including helicopters) which stay "
"in town for one full turn without moving are completely restored."
msgstr ""
"都市が熟練の航空ユニット (ヘリコプターとミサイルを含む) を生産できるようにし"
"ます。また、損傷した航空ユニット (同じくヘリコプターを含む) が移動せずに丸1"
"ターン都市に留まると、完全に回復します。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:110 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:110
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:109
msgid ""
"Two cities with Airports can airlift one unit per turn.  Airlifting "
"instantly transports the unit from one city to another and will use all of "
"the unit's movement points.  A unit must have some movement points left to "
"be airlifted."
msgstr ""
"空港のある2つの都市の間では、1ターンに1ユニットを空輸できます。空輸はユニット"
"をある都市から別の都市へ即座に輸送し、ユニットの移動力をすべて消費します。空"
"輸するには、ユニットに移動力が残っている必要があります。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:136 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:136
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:164
msgid ""
"Allows a city to grow larger than size 8.  A Sewer System is also required "
"for a city to grow larger than size 12."
msgstr ""
"都市が規模8を超えて成長できるようにします。都市が規模12を超えて成長するには下"
"水道も必要です。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:189 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:220
#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:250 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:192
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:224 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:254
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:220
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:252
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:282
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With a Barracks, each new land unit built in a city will automatically have "
"Veteran status, which means that its attack and defense strengths are "
"increased by 50%."
msgstr ""
"兵舎があると、都市で生産される新しい陸上ユニットは自動的に熟練状態になり、攻"
"撃力と防御力が50%増加します。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:193 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:224
#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:254 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:196
#: data/classic/buildings.ruleset:228 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:258
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:291 data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:323
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:353 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:288
#: data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:320 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:350
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:224
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:256
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:286
msgid ""
"Also, damaged land units which stay in town for one full turn without moving "
"are completely restored."
msgstr ""
"また、損傷した陸上ユニットが移動せずに丸1ターン都市に留まると、完全に回復しま"
"す。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:278 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:283
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:311
msgid ""
"A Cathedral makes 3 unhappy citizens content in a city, making it easier to "
"maintain order in that city; however, it does not affect citizens made "
"unhappy by military activity.  The discovery of Theology increases the "
"effect of a Cathedral, making an additional unhappy citizen content.  The "
"discovery of Communism lessens the effect of a Cathedral, reducing by one "
"the number of unhappy citizens made content."
msgstr ""
"大聖堂は都市の不満市民3人を平穏にし、都市の秩序を保ちやすくします。ただし、軍"
"事活動によって不満になった市民には効果がありません。神学を発見すると大聖堂の"
"効果が高まり、さらに不満市民1人が平穏になります。共産主義を発見すると大聖堂の"
"効果が弱まり、平穏になる不満市民の数が1減ります。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:308 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:313
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:341
msgid ""
"City Walls make it easier to defend a city.  They triple the defense "
"strength of units within the city against land and helicopter units.  They "
"are ineffective against airborne and sea units as well as Howitzers.  City "
"Walls also prevent the loss of population which occurs when a defending unit "
"is destroyed by a land unit."
msgstr ""
"城壁は都市の防衛を容易にします。陸上ユニットとヘリコプターユニットに対する都"
"市内のユニットの防御力を3倍にします。航空ユニットや海上ユニット、榴弾砲には効"
"果がありません。城壁はまた、防御ユニットが陸上ユニットに撃破されたときに起こ"
"る人口の減少も防ぎます。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:317 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:322
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:417 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:414
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:350
msgid "Coastal Defense"
msgstr "沿岸防衛"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:336 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:341
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:369
msgid ""
"Increases the defense strength of units within a city by a factor of 2 when "
"defending against bombardments from enemy ships."
msgstr ""
"敵の艦船による砲撃に対して防御するとき、都市内のユニットの防御力を2倍にしま"
"す。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:360
msgid ""
"Entertains the citizens of a city, making 3 unhappy citizens content.  (Four "
"after the discovery of Electronics.)  However, it does not affect citizens "
"made unhappy by military activity."
msgstr ""
"都市の市民を楽しませ、不満市民3人を平穏にします。(電子工学の発見後は4人。) た"
"だし、軍事活動によって不満になった市民には効果がありません。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:386 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:394
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Reduces the corruption and waste in a city by 50%, and makes the revolt cost "
"of the city 4 times bigger. (These effects are redundant in your capital "
"city.)"
msgstr ""
"都市の汚職と浪費を50%減らし、都市の反乱扇動費用を4倍にします。(首都ではこれら"
"の効果は意味がありません。)"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:390 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:397
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:398
msgid ""
"Under a Democracy, a Courthouse also makes 1 unhappy citizen content (unless "
"that citizen is unhappy about military activity)."
msgstr ""
"民主主義では、裁判所は不満市民1人も平穏にします (その市民が軍事活動によって不"
"満になっている場合を除く)。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:449 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:456
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:564 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:561
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:454
msgid "Harbor"
msgstr "港"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:469 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:476
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:474
msgid ""
"Gives one extra food resource on all Oceanic tiles. The city needs to be "
"coastal to build this improvement."
msgstr ""
"すべての海洋タイルで食料を1追加で産出します。この都市施設を建設するには、都市"
"が海岸沿いにある必要があります。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:503
msgid ""
"A city can only have one Power Plant, Hydro Plant, Nuclear Plant, or Solar "
"Plant.  A city can only build a Hydro Plant if it is next to (or on) a River "
"tile."
msgstr ""
"都市が持てるのは火力発電所、水力発電所、原子力発電所、太陽光発電所のいずれか1"
"つだけです。水力発電所を建設できるのは、川のタイルに隣接している (またはその"
"上にある) 都市だけです。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:605 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:615
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:610
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Together with a Factory, a Manufacturing Plant increases the shield "
"production in a city by 100%. A Manufacturing Plant on its own increases "
"shield production by 50%."
msgstr ""
"工場と合わせて、製造工場は都市のシールド生産を100%増加させます。製造工場単独"
"ではシールド生産を50%増加させます。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:639 data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:795
#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:958
msgid ""
"A city can only have one Power Plant, Hydro Plant, Nuclear Plant, or Solar "
"Plant."
msgstr ""
"都市が持てるのは火力発電所、水力発電所、原子力発電所、太陽光発電所のいずれか1"
"つだけです。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:648 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:669
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:791 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:789
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:653
msgid "Offshore Platform"
msgstr "海上プラットフォーム"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:667 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:688
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:672
msgid ""
"Adds 1 extra shield resource on all Oceanic tiles worked by a city.  The "
"city needs to be coastal to build this improvement."
msgstr ""
"都市が作業するすべての海洋タイルでシールドを1追加で産出します。この都市施設を"
"建設するには、都市が海岸沿いにある必要があります。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:692 data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:697
msgid ""
"Makes a city the capital and the center of your government. Corruption and "
"waste in other cities is related to how far away from the capital they are, "
"except when the government is Democracy or Communism. On top of this, "
"corruption and waste in your capital itself is half of what it would "
"otherwise be (as if it had a Courthouse)."
msgstr ""
"都市を首都とし、政府の中心にします。他の都市の汚職と浪費は首都からの距離に関"
"係します (政治体制が民主主義または共産主義の場合を除く)。さらに、首都自体の汚"
"職と浪費は通常の半分になります (裁判所があるのと同様)。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:699 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:719
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:845 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:843
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:704
msgid ""
"The cost to enemy Diplomats and Spies of inciting a revolt in a city also "
"depends upon the city's distance from the capital (under all forms of "
"government). Your capital city itself cannot be incited to revolt, and "
"enjoys a bonus when enemy agents try to evade your own agents stationed in "
"the city, or sabotage your buildings."
msgstr ""
"敵の外交官やスパイが都市で反乱を扇動する費用も、(すべての政治体制で) 首都から"
"の距離によって決まります。首都自体では反乱を扇動されず、敵の工作員が都市に駐"
"留するあなたの工作員から逃れようとしたり、あなたの都市施設を破壊工作しようと"
"したりするときにボーナスを得ます。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:717 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:742
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:936 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:905
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:727
msgid "Police Station"
msgstr "警察署"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:735 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:760
msgid ""
"Reduces the unhappiness caused by aggressively deployed military units owned "
"by the city by 2 under Democracy and 1 under Republic -- in other words, it "
"neutralizes the unhappiness caused by a single military unit. This "
"improvement has no effect under other governments."
msgstr ""
"都市が所有する攻撃的に配備された軍事ユニットによる不満を、民主主義では2、共和"
"制では1減らします。つまり、1つの軍事ユニットによる不満を打ち消します。他の政"
"治体制ではこの都市施設に効果はありません。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:743 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:771
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:961 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:930
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:753
msgid "Port Facility"
msgstr "港湾施設"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:762 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:790
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:980 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:949
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:772
msgid ""
"Allows a city to build veteran sea units.  Also, damaged sea units which "
"stay in town for one full turn without moving are completely restored."
msgstr ""
"都市が熟練の海上ユニットを生産できるようにします。また、損傷した海上ユニット"
"が移動せずに丸1ターン都市に留まると、完全に回復します。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:826 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:859
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1051 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1020
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:838
msgid "Research Lab"
msgstr "研究所"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:846
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Together with a Library, a Research Lab increases the science production of "
"a city by 100%. Together with a Library and a University, a Research Lab "
"increases the science production of a city by 150%."
msgstr ""
"図書館と合わせて、研究所は都市の科学の生産を100%増加させます。図書館と大学と"
"合わせると、研究所は都市の科学の生産を150%増加させます。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:854 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:887
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1084 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1053
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:866
msgid "SAM Battery"
msgstr "対空ミサイル陣地"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:872 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:905
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:884
msgid ""
"Doubles the defense of all units inside the city when attacked by aircraft "
"(not including helicopters or missiles)."
msgstr ""
"航空機 (ヘリコプターとミサイルを除く) に攻撃されたとき、都市内のすべてのユ"
"ニットの防御力を2倍にします。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:896 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:929
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:908
msgid ""
"Protects a city and its environs (up to 2 tiles away) from attacks by other "
"nations' Nuclear units. A Nuclear unit not owned by you or a teammate which "
"attacks a city with SDI Defense, or attacks a unit (or is deliberately "
"exploded) within range, is shot down and simply has no effect. Also, doubles "
"defense for units in the city against non-nuclear missiles."
msgstr ""
"都市とその周辺 (2タイル以内) を他国の核ユニットの攻撃から守ります。あなたや"
"チームメイトが所有していない核ユニットが、SDI 防衛システムのある都市を攻撃し"
"たり、範囲内のユニットを攻撃したり (または意図的に爆発させられたり) すると、"
"撃墜されてまったく効果がありません。また、核以外のミサイルに対する都市内のユ"
"ニットの防御力を2倍にします。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:907 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:940
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1136 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1105
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:917
msgid "Sewer System"
msgstr "下水道"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:926 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:959
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:936
msgid ""
"Allows a city to grow larger than size 12.  An Aqueduct is first required "
"for a city to grow larger than size 8."
msgstr ""
"都市が規模12を超えて成長できるようにします。都市が規模8を超えて成長するには、"
"まず上水道が必要です。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:932 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:967
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1162 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1131
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:944
msgid "Solar Plant"
msgstr "太陽光発電所"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:952
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Eliminates all pollution generated by production in a city. It also "
"increases the shield production of a Factory or Mfg. Plant in the city: a "
"Factory and a Solar Plant together give a 100% production bonus, and a "
"Factory, Mfg. Plant and Solar Plant together give a 150% production bonus."
msgstr ""
"都市の生産によって発生するすべての汚染をなくします。また、都市の工場や製造プ"
"ラントのシールド生産を増加させます。工場と太陽光発電所で合わせて100%、工場、"
"製造プラント、太陽光発電所で合わせて150%の生産ボーナスが得られます。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1057 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1100
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1345 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1277
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1077
msgid "Stock Exchange"
msgstr "証券取引所"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1077 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1120
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1097
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Together with a Bank, a Stock Exchange boosts tax and luxury production in a "
"city by 50%. Together with a Marketplace and a Bank, a Stock Exchange boosts "
"tax and luxury production in a city by 150%."
msgstr ""
"銀行と合わせて、証券取引所は都市の税と贅沢の生産を50%高めます。市場と銀行と合"
"わせると、証券取引所は都市の税と贅沢の生産を150%高めます。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1085 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1128
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1373 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1305
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1105
msgid "Super Highways"
msgstr "高速幹線道路"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1104 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1147
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Increases trade resources by 50% on all tiles with roads or railroads."
msgstr "道路または鉄道のあるすべてのタイルで交易を50%増加させます。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1110 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1155
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1407 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1339
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1130
msgid "Supermarket"
msgstr "スーパーマーケット"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1129 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1174
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1426 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Increases the food resources by 50% on each farmland tile which is being "
"used around the city.  Farmland tiles are those which have been irrigated a "
"second time."
msgstr ""
"都市の周辺で使用されている各農地タイルの食料を50%増加させます。農地タイルとは"
"2回目の灌漑を行ったタイルのことです。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1154
msgid ""
"Makes one unhappy citizen content. The Mysticism advance doubles this "
"effect, as does Oracle wonder. With both Mysticism and the Oracle, 4 "
"citizens are made content. Does not affect citizens made unhappy by military "
"activity."
msgstr ""
"不満市民1人を平穏にします。神秘主義の科学技術でこの効果は2倍になり、アポロー"
"ン神殿の不思議でも同様です。神秘主義とアポローン神殿の両方があれば市民4人が平"
"穏になります。軍事活動によって不満になった市民には効果がありません。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1206 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1251
msgid ""
"The entire map becomes permanently visible to the player who owns it -- the "
"player always has up-to-date knowledge of all terrain and cities (but not "
"units) despite fog-of-war. It allows all players to start building spaceship "
"parts (assuming they have researched the necessary technologies)."
msgstr ""
"これを所有するプレイヤーには、マップ全体が永続的に見えるようになります。戦場"
"の霧に関係なく、すべての地形と都市 (ユニットは除く) について常に最新の情報を"
"得られます。また、すべてのプレイヤーが宇宙船の部品の建設を開始できるようにな"
"ります (必要な科学技術を研究していることが前提です)。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1215 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1260
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1553 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1455
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1234
msgid "A.Smith's Trading Co."
msgstr "アダム・スミスの貿易会社"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1233
msgid ""
"City improvements which would normally have an upkeep of 1 are free of "
"upkeep, for all cities."
msgstr ""
"通常は維持費が1の都市施設について、すべての都市で維持費が無料になります。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1338 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1386
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1714 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1591
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1363
msgid "Eiffel Tower"
msgstr "エッフェル塔"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your reputation and goodwill among other nations is recovered four times as "
"fast."
msgstr "他の民族の間でのあなたの評判と信用が4倍の速さで回復します。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1433 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1482
msgid ""
"Makes one content citizen happy in every city. Makes two extra content "
"citizens happy in the city containing the Hanging Gardens (that is, a total "
"of 3). In the unlikely event where there are no content citizens to get the "
"effect of Hanging Gardens, the wonder applies to unhappy citizens (including "
"those unhappy about military activity), making each content then happy."
msgstr ""
"すべての都市で平穏な市民1人を満足にします。空中庭園のある都市では、さらに平穏"
"な市民2人を満足にします (つまり合計3人)。空中庭園の効果を受ける平穏な市民がい"
"ないというまれな場合には、不満市民 (軍事活動による不満市民を含む) に適用さ"
"れ、それぞれ平穏にしてから満足にします。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1461 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1511
msgid ""
"Works as if you had a Hydro Plant in every city.  (This reduces pollution "
"and increases the effects of Factories and Mfg. Plants.)"
msgstr ""
"すべての都市に水力発電所があるのと同様に機能します。(汚染を減らし、工場と製造"
"プラントの効果を高めます。)"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1509 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1560
msgid ""
"Makes two unhappy citizens content in every city (including citizens unhappy "
"about military activity)."
msgstr ""
"すべての都市で不満市民2人を平穏にします (軍事活動による不満市民を含む)。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1515 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1566
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1935 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1780
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1546
msgid "King Richard's Crusade"
msgstr "リチャード1世の十字軍"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1534 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1585
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1566
msgid ""
"Adds one extra shield resource on every tile around the city where it is "
"built."
msgstr "建設した都市の周辺のすべてのタイルでシールドを1追加で産出します。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1540 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1591
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1964 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1809
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1572
msgid "Leonardo's Workshop"
msgstr "ダ・ヴィンチの工房"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1559 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1610
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:1983 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1828
msgid "Upgrades one obsolete unit per game turn."
msgstr "ゲームの1ターンにつき旧式ユニットを1つアップグレードします。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1583
msgid ""
"Gives all your sea units 1 additional movement point. Makes all your new "
"military sea units veterans (for all cities)."
msgstr ""
"あなたのすべての海上ユニットの移動力を1増やします。(すべての都市で) 新しい軍"
"事用海上ユニットをすべて熟練にします。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1607
msgid "Gives all sea units 2 additional movement points."
msgstr "すべての海上ユニットの移動力を2増やします。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1634 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1687
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:2064 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1909
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1672
msgid "Marco Polo's Embassy"
msgstr "マルコ・ポーロの大使館"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1653 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1706
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:2083 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:1928
msgid "The player who owns it gets an embassy with all players."
msgstr "これを所有するプレイヤーはすべてのプレイヤーとの大使館を得ます。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1676 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1729
msgid ""
"Counts as having a Cathedral in each of your cities.  This makes 3 unhappy "
"citizens content in each city; however, it does not affect citizens made "
"unhappy by military activity.  The discovery of Theology increases the "
"effect of a Cathedral, making an additional unhappy citizen content.  The "
"discovery of Communism lessens the effect of a Cathedral, reducing by one "
"the number of unhappy citizens made content."
msgstr ""
"あなたの各都市に大聖堂があるものとみなされます。これにより各都市で不満市民3人"
"が平穏になります。ただし、軍事活動によって不満になった市民には効果がありませ"
"ん。神学を発見すると大聖堂の効果が高まり、さらに不満市民1人が平穏になります。"
"共産主義を発見すると大聖堂の効果が弱まり、平穏になる不満市民の数が1減ります。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1730
msgid "Counts as having a Granary in every city."
msgstr "すべての都市に穀物庫があるものとみなされます。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1754
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Boosts science production in each city with a Library by 50%.  (Counts as "
"having a Research Lab in all of your cities.)"
msgstr ""
"図書館のある各都市の科学の生産を50%高めます。(あなたのすべての都市に研究所が"
"あるものとみなされます。)"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1785 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1841
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:2322 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:2127
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1833
msgid "Statue of Liberty"
msgstr "自由の女神"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1810 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1866
#: data/sandbox/buildings.ruleset:2349 data/civ2civ3/buildings.ruleset:2154
#: data/multiplayer/buildings.ruleset:1859
msgid "Sun Tzu's War Academy"
msgstr "孫子の兵法学校"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1830
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All your new military land units become veterans (for all cities).  The "
"chance of a land unit becoming a veteran after a battle increases from 50% "
"to 100%."
msgstr ""
"(すべての都市で) 新しい軍事用陸上ユニットがすべて熟練になります。戦闘後に陸上"
"ユニットが熟練になる確率が50%から100%に上がります。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1855 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1911
msgid "All your units regain two extra hitpoints per turn."
msgstr "あなたのすべてのユニットは毎ターン体力をさらに2回復します。"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1886 data/classic/buildings.ruleset:1934
msgid ""
"Counts as a Police Station in every city. (That is, for each city, it "
"reduces the unhappiness caused by aggressively deployed military units owned "
"by that city by 2 under Democracy and 1 under Republic -- in other words, it "
"neutralizes the unhappiness caused by a single military unit per city. This "
"wonder has no effect under other governments.)"
msgstr ""
"すべての都市で警察署として機能します。(つまり、各都市について、その都市が所有"
"する攻撃的に配備された軍事ユニットによる不満を、民主主義では2、共和制では1減"
"らします。言い換えれば、都市ごとに1つの軍事ユニットによる不満を打ち消します。"
"他の政治体制ではこの不思議に効果はありません。)"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1896
msgid "Capitalization"
msgstr "現金化"

#: data/civ2/buildings.ruleset:1912
msgid ""
"This is not a normal improvement. Instead, setting a city's production to "
"Capitalization means its shield production is converted to tax output "
"(money)."
msgstr ""
"これは通常の都市施設ではありません。都市の生産を現金化に設定すると、シールド"
"の生産が税の産出 (お金) に変換されます。"

#: data/civ2/game.ruleset:32
msgid "Civ2 ruleset"
msgstr "Civ2 ルールセット"

#: data/civ2/game.ruleset:44
msgid ""
"You are playing with civ2 style rules. These are somewhat close to classic "
"(old default) Freeciv rules, but with some additions, and without certain "
"more recent changes."
msgstr ""
"civ2 風のルールでプレイしています。これらのルールは従来の (以前のデフォルト"
"の) Freeciv のルールにかなり近いですが、いくつかの追加があり、比較的新しい変"
"更の一部は含まれていません。"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:85
msgid ""
"Anarchy offers slightly less corruption and waste than Despotism, but "
"slightly more unhappiness."
msgstr ""
"無政府状態は専制政治よりも汚職と浪費がわずかに少ないですが、不満はわずかに多"
"くなります。"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:108
msgid ""
"Despotism suffers the highest level of corruption and waste of all forms of "
"government."
msgstr ""
"専制政治は、すべての政治体制の中で最も汚職と浪費の度合いが高くなります。"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:133
msgid ""
"Monarchy suffers the same small amount of corruption and waste that the "
"Republic does."
msgstr "君主制では共和制と同じ程度のわずかな汚職と浪費が生じます。"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:159
msgid ""
"Under Communism, corruption and waste does not vary by distance from the "
"capital; all cities (including the capital) have a modest amount of "
"corruption."
msgstr ""
"共産主義では、汚職と浪費は首都からの距離によって変化しません。(首都を含む) す"
"べての都市にほどほどの汚職があります。"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:168 data/civ2/techs.ruleset:359
#: data/sandbox/governments.ruleset:274 data/civ2civ3/governments.ruleset:273
#: data/multiplayer/governments.ruleset:217 data/multiplayer/techs.ruleset:363
msgid "Fundamentalism"
msgstr "原理主義"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:178 data/sandbox/governments.ruleset:284
#: data/civ2civ3/governments.ruleset:283
#: data/multiplayer/governments.ruleset:227
#, c-format
msgid "High Priest %s"
msgstr "%s大祭司"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:179 data/sandbox/governments.ruleset:285
#: data/civ2civ3/governments.ruleset:284
#: data/multiplayer/governments.ruleset:228
#, c-format
msgid "High Priestess %s"
msgstr "%s大女祭司"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:181 data/sandbox/governments.ruleset:287
#: data/civ2civ3/governments.ruleset:286
#: data/multiplayer/governments.ruleset:230
msgid ""
"Fundamentalism is a form of government organized around a central set of "
"beliefs. The beliefs, usually religious in nature, form a rigid guideline "
"for actions and reactions of both the rulers and the people."
msgstr ""
"原理主義は、中心となる一連の信条を軸に組織された政治体制です。その信条は通常"
"宗教的な性質のもので、統治者と人民双方の行動と反応の厳格な指針となります。"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:186 data/sandbox/governments.ruleset:292
#: data/civ2civ3/governments.ruleset:291
#: data/multiplayer/governments.ruleset:235
msgid ""
"In a fundamentalist society, the people and the rulers are entirely devoted "
"to their beliefs, and are usually willing to die to preserve them."
msgstr ""
"原理主義の社会では、人民と統治者は信条に完全に身を捧げており、通常はそれを守"
"るために死ぬこともいといません。"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:190 data/sandbox/governments.ruleset:296
#: data/civ2civ3/governments.ruleset:295
#: data/multiplayer/governments.ruleset:239
msgid ""
"Improvements that normally convert unhappy citizens to content citizens, "
"produce `tithes' (gold) equivalent to the number of people they would "
"convert, and require no maintenance."
msgstr ""
"通常は不満市民を平穏な市民に変える都市施設が、変えるはずだった人数に相当する"
"「十分の一税」(金) を生み出し、維持費も不要になります。"

#: data/civ2/governments.ruleset:237
msgid ""
"Under Democracy, citizens govern directly by voting on issues. Democracy "
"offers the highest possible level of trade, but also offers the most "
"potential for unhappiness.  There is no corruption or waste during "
"Democracy, but citizens become very upset during wars."
msgstr ""
"民主主義では、市民が問題ごとに投票して直接統治します。民主主義は可能な限り最"
"高の交易をもたらしますが、不満の可能性も最も大きくなります。民主主義では汚職"
"も浪費もありませんが、戦争中は市民が非常に動揺します。"

#: data/civ2/nations.ruleset:135 data/nation/american.ruleset:50
