#: data/sandbox/techs.ruleset:842 data/civ2civ3/techs.ruleset:817
#: data/multiplayer/techs.ruleset:796
msgid "Theology"
msgstr "神学"

#: data/civ2/techs.ruleset:794 data/classic/techs.ruleset:797
#: data/sandbox/techs.ruleset:848 data/civ2civ3/techs.ruleset:823
#: data/multiplayer/techs.ruleset:802
msgid "Improves the effect of Cathedrals."
msgstr "大聖堂の効果を高めます。"

#: data/civ2/techs.ruleset:821 data/classic/techs.ruleset:824
#: data/sandbox/techs.ruleset:878 data/civ2civ3/techs.ruleset:853
#: data/multiplayer/techs.ruleset:829
msgid "Warrior Code"
msgstr "兵法"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:260 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:409
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:419 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:418
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:403
msgid "Glacier"
msgstr "氷河"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:301 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:453
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:463 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:462
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:445
msgid ""
"Glaciers are found only in the most northerly or southerly reaches of the "
"world.  They are very cold, and hence difficult to work with."
msgstr ""
"氷河は世界の最北端または最南端にのみ存在します。非常に寒いため、作業が困難で"
"す。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:906 data/alien/terrain.ruleset:668
msgid "?gui_type:Build Land base"
msgstr "陸上基地を建設"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:909 data/alien/terrain.ruleset:671
msgid "?gui_type:Build Airforce base"
msgstr "空軍基地を建設"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1120
msgid ""
"The pollution can only be cleared by dispatching Settlers or Engineers with "
"the \"clean pollution\" order."
msgstr ""
"汚染は、開拓者またはエンジニアを派遣して「汚染除去」命令を与えることでのみ除"
"去できます。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1123 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1339
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:1400 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1399
msgid ""
"Pollution from production is likely to start becoming important as your "
"civilization becomes more industrialized, giving you buildings such as "
"Factory and Power Plant which boost production. Replacing a Power Plant with "
"cleaner forms of energy -- a Hydro Plant / Hoover Dam, Nuclear Plant, or "
"Solar Plant -- will reduce pollution from production, as will a Recycling "
"Center."
msgstr ""
"生産による汚染は、文明が工業化し、工場や火力発電所などの生産を高める都市施設"
"を手に入れるにつれて重要になり始めるでしょう。火力発電所をよりクリーンなエネ"
"ルギー (水力発電所/フーバーダム、原子力発電所、太陽光発電所) に置き換えると生"
"産による汚染が減り、リサイクル施設でも同様に減ります。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1184 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1400
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:1463 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1462
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1375
msgid ""
"Later in the game, helicopters may also enter villages, but overflight by "
"other aircraft will cause the villagers to take fright and disband."
msgstr ""
"ゲームの後半にはヘリコプターも村に入ることができますが、他の航空機が上空を飛"
"ぶと村人は怯えて解散してしまいます。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1190 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1406
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:1499 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1468
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1381
msgid "Farmland"
msgstr "農地"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1211 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1427
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:1522 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1491
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once Refrigeration is known, irrigation systems can be upgraded to farmland "
"by irrigating them a second time; if the city working the tile has a "
"Supermarket, a farmland tile provides 50% more food. (Hence, farmland is "
"only useful on tiles which with irrigation yield 2 or more food.)"
msgstr ""
"冷蔵を習得すると、灌漑施設に2回目の灌漑を行うことで農地にアップグレードできま"
"す。そのタイルで作業する都市にスーパーマーケットがあれば、農地タイルは50%多く"
"の食料を産出します。(そのため、農地が役立つのは灌漑によって食料を2以上産出す"
"るタイルだけです。)"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1217
msgid "Like irrigation, farmland is incompatible with mines."
msgstr "灌漑と同様に、農地は鉱山と両立しません。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1247
msgid ""
"Fortresses improve defense for land units outside cities. Among other "
"effects, a land unit remaining in a fortress for a whole turn without moving "
"recovers a quarter of its hit points."
msgstr ""
"要塞は都市の外にいる陸上ユニットの防御力を高めます。その他の効果として、移動"
"せずに丸1ターン要塞に留まった陸上ユニットは体力の4分の1を回復します。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1258 data/civ2/units.ruleset:24
#: data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1506 data/classic/units.ruleset:30
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:1732 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1658
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1478 data/multiplayer/units.ruleset:30
msgid "Airbase"
msgstr "飛行場"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1282 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1529
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1501
msgid ""
"Airbases allow your air units to land and refuel outside cities. Air units "
"in an airbase may be attacked also by land units."
msgstr ""
"空軍基地があると、航空ユニットは都市の外で着陸して燃料を補給できます。空軍基"
"地にいる航空ユニットは陸上ユニットからも攻撃されることがあります。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1285 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1532
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:41 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:40
#: data/alien/terrain.ruleset:1046 data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1504
msgid "Units can paradrop from this tile."
msgstr "このタイルからユニットが降下できます。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1351 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1652
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:1930 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1822
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1624
msgid ""
"A railroad also increases any shield resources produced by a tile by half. A "
"tile whose road is upgraded to a railroad retains any trade bonus from the "
"road as well."
msgstr ""
"鉄道はまた、タイルが産出するシールドを半分増加させます。道路を鉄道にアップグ"
"レードしたタイルは、道路による交易ボーナスもそのまま保持します。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1355 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1656
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:1934 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1826
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1628
msgid ""
"City center tiles with roads are automatically upgraded to railroads when "
"you learn the Railroad technology."
msgstr ""
"道路のある都市中心のタイルは、鉄道の科学技術を習得すると自動的に鉄道にアップ"
"グレードされます。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1378 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1678
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1650
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any land terrain type may have a River on it.  A River adds 1 trade to the "
"resources produced by that tile.  It also increases a tile's defense factor "
"by 50%.  Finally, land units may move along a River (but not diagonally) for "
"fast travel."
msgstr ""
"どの種類の陸地の地形にも川があることがあります。川はそのタイルが産出する資源"
"に交易を1加えます。また、タイルの防御係数を50%増加させます。さらに、陸上ユ"
"ニットは川に沿って (ただし斜めではなく) 高速で移動できます。"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1403 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1703
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:2030 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1920
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1675
msgid "Iron"
msgstr "鉄"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1431 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1731
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:2058 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1948
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1703
msgid "Furs"
msgstr "毛皮"

#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1473 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1773
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:2100 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:1990
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1745
