#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1501 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1801
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:2128 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:2018
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1773
msgid "Buffalo"
