#: data/civ2/terrain.ruleset:1515 data/classic/terrain.ruleset:1815
#: data/sandbox/terrain.ruleset:2142 data/civ2civ3/terrain.ruleset:2032
#: data/multiplayer/terrain.ruleset:1787
msgid "Wheat"
